# libSceWebBrowserDialog - #101, the system web browser (src/evo_webui.c).
#
# A provider's own web UI (Emby) opens in it. Linked into every player build. No SDK
# stub .so exists for it. Names from SharpProspero
# Interop/Dialog/WebBrowserDialog.cs, the console-tested binding.
#
# Exactly the six the probe calls: every name here is an unconditional
# positional import, and a name missing from the firmware's .sprx makes the
# loader reject the whole module (CE-108255-1, no log). If a build
# does not start at all, suspect this file first.
sceWebBrowserDialogInitialize
sceWebBrowserDialogOpen
sceWebBrowserDialogUpdateStatus
sceWebBrowserDialogGetResult
sceWebBrowserDialogClose
sceWebBrowserDialogTerminate
